のラストでまだまだヤり足りないヒカリがレックスを襲って(？)終わります。\nリクエストをしたいのは、その後口やパイズリで何度も射精させて騎乗位でSEXするヒカリ。挑発気味にレックスを奮起させようと言い、レックスも負けじと両手でヒカリの胸もしくは乳首を捏ねて必死に腰を振ります。\nヒカリも胸とオマンコ同時による快感でイキそうになる\n最後は二人合わせて絶頂してヒカリは満足して終わる。\n\nご不満や不快な内容であればすいません。\nどうかよろしくお願いいたします！", "nc": 33, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 367149, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "えるう🔞", "screen_name": "eruuman", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2008435770961653760/HN3iq4tV.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1217083430413799424/1730378548/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 177}, {"id": 416965, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "おやす⚠️NSFW🔞", "screen_name": "oyasu3755", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1254593460369162240/gMPBkGrn.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1176302619192508417/1675686852/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 520094, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "あまがえる🦊マグコミ＆永遠娘コミックス2冊発売中", "screen_name": "HylaTheWet", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1927900267133161473/geRP76QD.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1741717848949714944/1767782418/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_a